#: ../../../source/index.md:1
msgid "Deep Learning Club 学习教程"
msgstr "Deep Learning Club Course Materials"

#: ../../../source/index.md:19
msgid "欢迎来到深度学习：一群人在黑盒子里找规律，70%的数据清洗，20%的调参玄学，10%的祈祷。有时候能找到规律，有时候找到的是过拟合。但至少，我们的loss曲线很好看！"
msgstr "Welcome to deep learning: a group of people searching for patterns inside a black box—70% data cleaning, 20% hyperparameter alchemy, and 10% prayer. Sometimes we find a pattern; sometimes we find overfitting. At least our loss curve looks good!"

#: ../../../source/index.md:21
msgid "这是我们深度学习社的教学资料库，面向具备微积分基础的高中生，提供从理论到实践的深度学习课程。"
msgstr "This is the Deep Learning Club's course-materials library. It offers a deep-learning course from theory to practice for high-school students with a foundation in calculus."

#: ../../../source/index.md:23
msgid "学习路径"
msgstr "Learning path"

#: ../../../source/index.md:39
msgid "**核心路径**（必修）：数学基础 → 翻越两座山 → PyTorch实践 **进阶路径**（选修）：根据兴趣选择一个或多个方向深入研究"
msgstr "**Core Path** (Required): Math Fundamentals → Crossing Two Mountains → PyTorch Practice **Advanced Path** (Elective): Deep dive into one or more directions based on your interest"

#: ../../../source/index.md:42
msgid "前置知识"
msgstr "Prerequisites"

#: ../../../source/index.md:42
msgid "领域"
msgstr "Domain"

#: ../../../source/index.md:42
msgid "要求"
msgstr "Requirement"

#: ../../../source/index.md:42
msgid "具体内容"
msgstr "Specific Content"

#: ../../../source/index.md:42
msgid "**数学**"
msgstr "**Mathematics**"

#: ../../../source/index.md:42
msgid "必修"
msgstr "Required"

#: ../../../source/index.md:42
msgid "微积分（导数、链式法则）、线性代数（矩阵乘法）、基础概率论"
msgstr "Calculus (derivatives, chain rule), Linear Algebra (matrix multiplication), Basic Probability Theory"

#: ../../../source/index.md:42
msgid "**编程**"
msgstr "**Programming**"

#: ../../../source/index.md:42
msgid "Python基础（函数、类、NumPy数组操作）"
msgstr "Python basics (functions, classes, NumPy array operations)"

#: ../../../source/index.md:42
msgid "**深度学习**"
msgstr "**Deep Learning**"

#: ../../../source/index.md:42
msgid "无需"
msgstr "None"

#: ../../../source/index.md:42
msgid "本课程从零开始，不需要前置知识"
msgstr "This course starts from scratch and requires no prior deep learning knowledge"

#: ../../../source/index.md:52
msgid "**配套教材**：斋藤康毅《深度学习入门：基于Python的理论与实现》（俗称\"鱼书\"）。"
msgstr "**Companion Textbook**: Koki Saito's *Deep Learning from Scratch: Building with Python from First Principles* (commonly known as the \"Fish Book\")."

#: ../../../source/index.md:54
msgid "鱼书从Python/NumPy出发，**不依赖任何外部库**，手把手教你从零手写神经网络。本材料使用**PyTorch**，侧重\"为什么\"和\"怎么用好\"。两者是**互补关系**："
msgstr "The Fish Book starts with Python/NumPy, **without relying on any external libraries**, taking you step by step through building neural networks from scratch. These materials use **PyTorch**, focusing on \"why\" and \"how to use it well.\" The two are **complementary**:"

#: ../../../source/index.md:55
#, python-brace-format
msgid "鱼书第3章（神经网络）→ 本材料{doc}`cnn-expedition/index`"
msgstr "Fish Book Ch. 3 (Neural Networks) → {doc}`cnn-expedition/index`"

#: ../../../source/index.md:56
#, python-brace-format
msgid "鱼书第5章（计算图/反向传播）→ 本材料{doc}`math-fundamentals/index`"
msgstr "Fish Book Ch. 5 (Computational Graphs / Backpropagation) → {doc}`math-fundamentals/index`"

#: ../../../source/index.md:57
#, python-brace-format
msgid "鱼书第7章（手写CNN）→ 本材料{doc}`cnn-expedition/index`"
msgstr "Fish Book Ch. 7 (Handwritten CNN) → {doc}`cnn-expedition/index`"

#: ../../../source/index.md:59
#, python-brace-format
msgid "详见{doc}`preface`中的完整对照说明与8周并行学习计划。"
msgstr "See {doc}`preface` for full comparison details and an 8-week parallel study plan."

