msgstr "Estimated Time"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "核心目标"
msgstr "Core Objective"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "**基础阶段**"
msgstr "**Foundational Stage**"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "数学基础"
msgstr "Math Fundamentals"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "2-3小时"
msgstr "2–3 hours"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "理解计算图、反向传播和梯度下降的核心机制"
msgstr "Understand the core mechanisms of computational graphs, backpropagation, and gradient descent"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "翻越两座山"
msgstr "Crossing Two Mountains"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "7-9小时"
msgstr "7–9 hours"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "全连接→CNN→LeNet（上篇），AlexNet到EfficientNet（下篇），消融研究，架构心法"
msgstr "Fully connected → CNN → LeNet (Part 1), AlexNet to EfficientNet (Part 2), ablation studies, architecture principles"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "**实践阶段**"
msgstr "**Practice Stage**"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "PyTorch实践"
msgstr "PyTorch Practice"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "4-5小时"
msgstr "4–5 hours"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "动手搭建并训练完整神经网络"
msgstr "Hands-on building and training complete neural networks"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "**进阶阶段**"
msgstr "**Advanced Stage**"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "模型部署"
msgstr "Model Serving"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "3-4小时"
msgstr "3–4 hours"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "ONNX导出、量化剪枝、服务架构、Ferrinx部署上线"
msgstr "ONNX export, quantization & pruning, serving architecture, Ferrinx production deployment"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "迁移学习"
msgstr "Transfer Learning"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "掌握小数据集训练大模型的核心技术"
msgstr "Master core techniques for training large models on small datasets"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "U-Net分割"
msgstr "U-Net Segmentation"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "实现图像分割模型，理解编码器-解码器架构"
msgstr "Implement image segmentation models and understand encoder-decoder architectures"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "CNN架构改造"
msgstr "CNN Architecture Modification"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "掌握CNN架构设计心法（属翻越两座山章，独立选修）"
msgstr "Master CNN architecture design principles (part of Crossing Two Mountains chapter, standalone elective)"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "序列建模"
msgstr "Sequence Modeling"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "4-6小时"
msgstr "4–6 hours"

#: ../../../source/index.md:61
msgid "理解RNN/LSTM/Transformer/Mamba的演化逻辑"
msgstr "Understand the evolutionary logic from RNN/LSTM to Transformer and Mamba"

#: ../../../source/index.md:76
msgid "**学习建议**：理论理解 40% + 代码实践 60% = 最佳效果"
msgstr "**Study Suggestion**: 40% Theoretical Understanding + 60% Code Practice = Optimal Results"

#: ../../../source/index.md:78
msgid "技术特点"
msgstr "Technical features"

#: ../../../source/index.md:82
msgid "**构建系统**：Sphinx + Markdown，支持HTML/PDF输出"
msgstr "**Build System**: Sphinx + Markdown, supporting HTML/PDF output"

#: ../../../source/index.md:83
msgid "**数学支持**：LaTeX公式渲染"
msgstr "**Math Support**: LaTeX formula rendering"

#: ../../../source/index.md:84
msgid "**可视化**：TikZ图表、Mermaid流程图"
msgstr "**Visualization**: TikZ diagrams, Mermaid flowcharts"

#: ../../../source/index.md:85
msgid "**代码实践**：完整PyTorch实现，每行代码带详细注释"
msgstr "**Code Practice**: Complete PyTorch implementations with detailed line-by-line comments"

#: ../../../source/index.md:86
msgid "**Cross-Reference**：章节间紧密关联，形成知识网络"
msgstr "**Cross-Reference**: Chapters are tightly interconnected, forming a knowledge network"

