#: ../../../source/index.md:105
msgid ""
"⚠️ **警告**：本课程包含大量梯度下降、反向传播和玄学调参。副作用可能包括：对 GPU "
"产生依赖、对过拟合产生恐惧、以及半夜醒来突然想到\"是不是学习率太大\"。"
msgstr ""
"⚠️ **Warning**: This course contains a large amount of gradient descent, backpropagation, and hyperparameter alchemy. Side effects may include: GPU dependency, fear of overfitting, and waking up in the middle of the night wondering \"is the learning rate too high?\""

